#===============================================================================
#  ARDHANARISHVARA OS — ENGINEERING SUPPORT DOCUMENT
#  SovereignOS Storage Engine v8 — Locality-Aware XorRS Unified
#  File: storage_engine_v8_locality_aware.support
#===============================================================================
#  PURPOSE:
#    Engineering reference for the SovereignOS Storage Engine v8:
#      • locality-aware shard placement
#      • rack/zone/region topology awareness
#      • automatic repair path selection
#      • unified XorRS hybrid parity
#      • distributed snapshots
#
#===============================================================================
#  MODULE SUMMARY:
#
#    - [Locality-Aware Placement](ca://s?q=Explain_Locality_Aware_Placement)
#    - [Rack/Zone/Region Topology](ca://s?q=Explain_Storage_Topology)
#    - [Local Repair](ca://s?q=Explain_XorRS_Local_Repair)
#    - [Secondary Repair](ca://s?q=Explain_XorRS_Secondary_Repair)
#    - [Global RS Repair](ca://s?q=Explain_XorRS_Global_RS)
#    - [Automatic Repair Selection](ca://s?q=Explain_XorRS_Automatic_Repair)
#
#===============================================================================
#  FUNCTION OVERVIEW:
#
#    - create_volume(name, size_mb, nodes)
#         Creates locality-aware XorRS Unified volume.
#
#    - write(volume_id, data)
#         Encodes data into groups, local parity, secondary parity, global RS.
#         Places shards across racks/zones/regions.
#
#    - read(volume_id, shard_ids)
#         Automatically selects best repair path based on locality.
#
#    - snapshot(volume_id)
#         Creates distributed snapshot.
#
#    - restore(snapshot_id)
#         Restores shard map from snapshot.
#
#    - engine_snapshot()
#         Returns engine state.
#
#===============================================================================
#  NODE FORMAT:
#
#    {
#      "id": "NODE-1",
#      "rack": "R1",
#      "zone": "Z1",
#      "region": "REG-A"
#    }
#
#===============================================================================
#  SHARD MAP FORMAT:
#
#    {
#      "XRS8VOL-XXXX": {
#          "SHR-A": {"node": "NODE-1", "rack": "R1", "zone": "Z1", "region": "REG-A"},
#          "SHR-B": {"node": "NODE-2", "rack": "R2", "zone": "Z1", "region": "REG-A"},
#          ...
#      }
#    }
#
